Leave sections of a COMDAT group unloaded unless referenced when another object defines the
group's signature symbol. They were loaded under --no-gc-sections and through SHF_GNU_RETAIN,
so libobjc2 ran .objcv2_load_function once per object and its legacy ABI tests aborted.

